1
00:00:00,300 --> 00:00:02,400
And then you see something red in the
snow.

2
00:00:03,100 --> 00:00:03,833
That's her coat.

3
00:00:05,500 --> 00:00:08,700
It's empty. It's lying open in the
snow. At twenty below.

4
00:00:09,400 --> 00:00:10,767
Mia! Mia!

5
00:00:11,800 --> 00:00:14,033
Why would anyone take off a coat in a
blizzard?

6
00:00:14,733 --> 00:00:19,600
Rule eight. If you feel hot in a
blizzard, you're dying. Never take
your coat off.

7
00:00:20,300 --> 00:00:29,333
Doctors have a name for it. In the
last stage of hypothermia, the blood
rushes back to the skin. You feel like
you're on fire. People undress in the
snow.
